        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamwambia, Usiogope, maana bila shaka nitakutendea mema; kwa ajili ya Yonathani, baba yako, nami nitakurudishia mashamba yote ya Sauli, baba yako; nawe utakula chakula mezani pangu daima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
