                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo Mefiboshethi alikuwa na mwana mdogo, jina lake akiitwa Mika. Na watu wote waliokaa nyumbani mwa Siba walikuwa watumwa wa Mefiboshethi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
